    {
      "name": "cursor_create_run",
      "description": "Sends a follow-up run to the same agent (new run). PAID. The agent keeps its conversation: a follow-up needs no full resume prompt. Without model_id, the agent keeps its current model. With model_id (and model_params, reasoning_level, checked against the catalog), the model changes for this run and the following ones; the API does not allow re-reading the active model. Refused if the agent is archived, if its status is unknown, or if workOnCurrentBranch is not false.\nThe API cannot send a message to a run in progress (AGENT_BUSY). replace_active=true redirects the agent instead: it cancels the current run (its work in progress stops, pushed commits stay), waits until it is re-read terminal, then sends this follow-up; replaced_run_id names the stopped run. If the run is not terminal in time, nothing is sent (AGENT_BUSY).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
